  "label": "Racial Stereotype in Meme",
  "description": "The meme leverages a racial stereotype by associating the Black man with hypersexualization, implying that his worth or identity is tied to sexual performance. This stereotype is rooted in historical and systemic racism that has long portrayed Black men as hypersexual and dangerous, contributing to their marginalization and dehumanization.",
